# Cursor rules — Finepro Tools

`AGENTS.md` is the authoritative AI-agent guide. Read it before editing; use `CONVENTIONS.md` and nearby feature code for implementation details.

- Expo 55, React Native 0.83.10, TypeScript strict, Expo Router typed routes.
- Use Yarn only; run `yarn validate` before handoff.
- Preserve unrelated changes and never modify `.env`.
- Use `react-native-unistyles` and theme tokens; reuse `@/common/components`.
- Translate visible text in en, vi, zh-CN, and zh-TW.
- React Query owns remote state; Zustand selectors own shared client state; auth stays in `useAuthStore`.
- Use the Axios client already selected by the target feature; the repo has multiple backend clients.
- No `any`, suppression comments, hardcoded colors, or `--no-verify`.
- The app has dashboard/settings tabs and manufacturing feature routes; do not generate obsolete batches/alerts screens.
- Do not commit, push, deploy, publish OTA updates, or produce release artifacts unless asked.
